@startuml
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM A — Skenario Autentikasi & Login
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title **Sequence Diagram — Autentikasi & Login**

actor "Anggota\n(Pengguna)"      as U
participant "App Flutter\n(Frontend)"  as App
participant "AuthApiController" as C
participant "User\n(Model)"     as M
database "Database\n(MySQL)"    as DB

autonumber
U -> App   : Input email & password
App -> C   : POST /api/login (kredensial)
C -> M     : findByEmail(email)
M -> DB    : SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
DB --> M   : data user
M --> C    : Object User

alt Kredensial valid
  C -> C   : verifikasi hash password
  C -> C   : generateToken() (Sanctum)
  C --> App: HTTP 200 OK (token + data user)
  App --> U: Arahkan ke halaman Dashboard
else Kredensial tidak valid
  C --> App: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
  App --> U: Tampilkan pesan error
end

caption Gambar 3.5 Sequence Diagram Autentikasi & Login
footer Sequence Diagram — SmartMart | Modul Pengguna & Dashboard | Tugas Akhir
@enduml
